  "name": "Plasma Storm Stage 1 Blister",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Released with Plasma Storm on 6 February 2013, in two versions, each an evolution line: Drifloon from Dragons Exalted with the holofoil Drifblim promo BW64, or the Jigglypuff promo BW65 with a cosmos holofoil Wigglytuff from Next Destinies made for the blister, each with a Plasma Storm booster pack and a sampling pack of three common cards. These copies use the pixel-pattern cosmos holofoil of the time; the Plasma Storm Rerelease Blister of 2015 has Drifblim and Wigglytuff on the smoother cosmos holofoil.",
